{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34280","headline":"祝牛宫辞 · 陆龟蒙","name":"祝牛宫辞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四牸三牯，中一去乳。\n天霜降寒，纳此室处。\n老农拘拘，度地不亩。\n东西几何，七举其武。\n南北几何，丈二加五。\n偶楹当闲，载尺入土。\n太岁在亥，余不足数。\n上缔蓬茅，下远官府。\n耕耨以时，饮食得所。\n或寝或卧，免风免雨。\n宜尔子孙，实我仓庾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34280.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34280","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}